:0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"**Migrated issue, originally created by Jeff Dairiki ([@dairiki](https://github.com/dairiki))**\n\nThe attached script fails with `sqlalchemy.exc.InvalidRequestError`: `contains() doesn't apply to a scalar endpoint; use ==` in SQLAlchemy==1.2.  It works with SQLAlchemy==1.1.15 (and before).\n\nThe crux here is:\n\n```\nTeam.events = association_proxy('eventteams', 'event')\n```\n\n\nwhere the proxied attribute is itself an association proxy:\n\n```\nEventTeam.event = association_proxy('division', 'event')\n```\n\nIn this case the expression `Team.events.contains(some_event)` is what elicits the exception.\n\n----------------------------------------\nAttachments: [chained_proxy.py](../wiki/imported_issue_attachments/4150/chained_proxy.py)\n\n","closed_by":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4150/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart